# LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows included. The Supabase CLI records a seed
# file's hash from its bytes (supabase_migrations.seed_files): a CRLF checkout on Windows made the
# hosted project record another hash than CI's LF copy, and deploy-dev stopped on "hash update".
# After this file arrives, a Windows copy is turned to LF once: CLAUDE.md → "Windows'ta satır
# sonları".
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
